WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:08.750
Point is, Colin, we don't not care.

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:10.840
We care very much.

00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:13.720
We care about who you are and what you

00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:16.219
must have been going through.

00:00:16.219 --> 00:00:18.094
Yeah?

00:00:18.094 --> 00:00:22.430
Hey, from now on, you don't have to go through it

00:00:22.430 --> 00:00:24.230
all by yourself.

00:00:24.230 --> 00:00:24.730
Yeah.

00:00:24.730 --> 00:00:25.230
All right?

00:00:25.230 --> 00:00:26.180
[OVERLAPPING VOICES]

00:00:26.180 --> 00:00:26.760
100% got you.

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:27.260
Hear that.

00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:28.640
You've got us, mate.

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:29.820
We've got you.

00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:30.320
OK.

00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:33.150
Well, look, hey, I hate to bring up work in a moment like this,

00:00:33.150 --> 00:00:35.390
but we do have a second half of a match to play.

00:00:35.390 --> 00:00:36.440
Coach, what have we got?

00:00:36.440 --> 00:00:37.880
Playing a man down.

00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:39.440
What do we do differently?

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:41.110
Absolutely nothing.

00:00:41.110 --> 00:00:43.086
[CHEERS, APPLAUSE]

00:00:43.086 --> 00:00:44.068
Let's go.

00:00:44.068 --> 00:00:44.568
Come on.

00:00:44.568 --> 00:00:46.050
Nice one.

00:00:46.050 --> 00:00:47.450
Let's go.

00:00:47.450 --> 00:00:48.510
OK, OK.

00:00:48.510 --> 00:00:49.020
All right.

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:50.160
Captain, count us off.

00:00:52.820 --> 00:00:53.320
Oh, wow.

00:00:53.320 --> 00:00:53.820
That's me.

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:54.970
Yes.

00:00:54.970 --> 00:00:56.660
OK.

00:00:56.660 --> 00:00:57.800
I don't know what to say.

00:01:00.480 --> 00:01:02.220
I'm honored to be your captain.

00:01:02.220 --> 00:01:04.930
And I love you guys so very much.

00:01:04.930 --> 00:01:05.430
On 3.

00:01:05.430 --> 00:01:06.390
1, 2, 3.

00:01:06.390 --> 00:01:08.190
I love you guys so very much!

00:01:08.190 --> 00:01:11.240
[CHEERING]

